        <div style="font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy);line-height:1;">5.0</div>
        <div style="color:#b45309;font-size:1rem;">★★★★★</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--muted);">Google · 53 reviews</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-reviews">
        <div class="pf-review"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><div class="pf-review-quote">"</div><span style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;background:#f0fdf4;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:999px;padding:0.15rem 0.5rem;">Verified Google Review</span></div><p>Great company, came within 30 mins for emergency burst pipe, couldn’t praise them enough !!</p><div class="pf-review-footer"><div class="pf-review-avatar">J</div><div><div class="pf-review-name">James Alexander</div><div class="pf-review-loc">Burst Pipe Emergency</div></div><div class="pf-review-stars">★★★★★</div></div></div>
        <div class="pf-review"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><div class="pf-review-quote">"</div><span style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;background:#f0fdf4;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:999px;padding:0.15rem 0.5rem;">Verified Google Review</span></div><p>Fantastic service less than two hours after phoneing up to order a new shower the job was done the young man who fitted it was a credit to himself I would highly recommend this company</p><div class="pf-review-footer"><div class="pf-review-avatar">J</div><div><div class="pf-review-name">John Manley</div><div class="pf-review-loc">Shower Installation</div></div><div class="pf-review-stars">★★★★★</div></div></div>
        <div class="pf-review"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><div class="pf-review-quote">"</div><span style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;background:#f0fdf4;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:999px;padding:0.15rem 0.5rem;">Verified Google Review</span></div><p>Excellent service.</p><div class="pf-review-footer"><div class="pf-review-avatar">E</div><div><div class="pf-review-name">Elaine McHugh</div><div class="pf-review-loc">Google Review</div></div><div class="pf-review-stars">★★★★★</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ALL WIRRAL SERVICES -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 >Plumbers on the Wirral for Every Job</h2>
